dence medium --summary \"The agent never delegates: max_subagents is 0 and no spawn or handoff code exists.\" --next \"Governance to approve N/A; a fresh challenger must confirm no delegation path.\"\nA check E09.1 --met unknown --note \"No descendants, remote workers or queues exist. The stop watcher cancels the single run task including in-flight calls (killswitch.py:52-59, main.py:87). Open-stream/task cases not applicable but not ledgered.\"\nA check E09.2 --met no --evidence src/credentials.py:20 --quote 'TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS = 300' --note \"Stopping only sets a flag read by agent and gateway; nothing revokes issued tokens (drop_subject at credentials.py:68 is never called). Tokens live 300 s against a 10 s stop target (config/agent.yaml:51). The gateway refuses stopped callers (gateway.py:171), but the direct_route path (gateway_client.py:59) has no stop check, so those tokens stay usable.\"\nA check E09.3 --met unknown --note \"No queues or schedulers. Approval resume checks stop flags (agent.py:131) and the main loop checks before each model call (agent.py:66). The gateway_client fallback retry (gateway_client.py:51-59) does not recheck the flag, but the watcher cancels the task.\"\nA check E09.4 --met unknown --note \"Completed tool results are audited (agent.py:195). The stop path (main.py:91-94) records run_stopped only, with no list of in-flight or unknown-outcome calls to reconcile. Not confirmed.\"\nA flag E09 --evidence src/credentials.py:20 --note \"300 s tokens with no revocation on stop; direct_route path has no stop check\"\nA item E09 --rating gap --confidence medium --summary \"Stop sets a flag but issued 300 s tokens are not revoked, and the direct route skips the gateway stop check.\" --next \"Remove direct_route so the gateway stop check always applies, shorten token lifetime to the stop time or revoke on stop, and record in-flight calls at stop.\" --violates \"It must revoke access as needed\" --also-affects E06\ncd ..; /private/tmp/claude-501/